MID_LGV_1LED_c04_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_B01_m01_001: Leda, right? I know of you. You've been accepted as\nan entrant in the Heroic Games.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_B01_m01_002: The opening announcements will begin soon.\nPlease, make your way to the stands.
MID_LGA_1LED_c04_B01_m01: <BLN>I'm an organizer for the games.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m01_001: Lechner will make his move shortly before the new\nmoon. We should make ours on {SetColor=Gold}{DateTime=Month} {DateTime=Day}{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGA_1LED_c04_Sci_m01: <BLN>Are you ready?
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m05_001: The new moon is tomorrow, which means Lechner's\nsetting out. We should too.
MID_LGA_1LED_c04_Sci_m05: <BLN>Are you done preparing?
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Buc_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Buc_m01_001: During my time in Dagsion I rose to the level of\npilus prior.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Buc_m01_002: But when Lord Guillermo was appointed the viceroy\nof Cydonia, I gave up my role and went with him.
MID_LGA_1LED_c04_Buc_m01: <BLN>That was long ago now...
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m02_001: It's been a while since I visited, but the breeze that\nblows through Dagsion's streets is as lovely as ever.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m02_002: Now, to find a beauty to share my bed with. I'd best\nhead into town and scout one out!
MID_LGA_1LED_c04_Sci_m02: <BLN>With whom to spend my evening?
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Moo_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Moo_m01_001: I've never seen such a dazzling city. We really just\npoofed ourselves into Dagsion?
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Moo_m01_002: The gods must really be great, if they can do things\nlike that!
MID_LGA_1LED_c04_Moo_m01: <BLN>I can't believe it.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Oly_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Oly_m01_001: How I adore the city! Not least thanks to the lack\nof unpleasant insects...
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Oly_m01_002: You know, I can't recall how long it's been since I\nlast visited Dagsion.
MID_LGA_1LED_c04_Oly_m01: <BLN>How long has it been?
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Buc_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Buc_m02_001: When I left Dagsion, I made a vow.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Buc_m02_002: I would protect Lord Guillermo with my life.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Buc_m02_003: In spite of that oath, it is I who survived, while he\nwas killed.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Buc_m02_004: But it's alright, milady. Now my utmost duty is\nprotecting you.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Buc_m02_005: I will do that at the cost of my life—for whatever\nthis faded life is worth.
MID_LGA_1LED_c04_Buc_m02: <BLN>I intend to see it to the end.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m03_001: Miss Leda, is this your first time in Dagsion?
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m03_002: I'd be delighted to give you a tour, should you desire.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m03_003: <NCA>Tell him you'll consider it.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m03_004: <NCB>Tell him to lay off.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m03_005: <ACA>Good! I can accompany you to the theater,\nthe tavern, the port...
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m03_006: <ACA>or the secret garden where lovers impart to each\nother sweet nothings.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m03_007: <ACA>Why are you looking at me like that?
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m03_008: <ACB>So you don't need one? I see your walls are sturdy\nas ever.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m03_009: <ACB>You know, even on a man like me, ceaseless\nrejection takes its toll.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m03_010: Anyway, if you're of the mind to head to the {SetColor=Gold}tavern{SetColor=Default},\nhead down those stairs into {SetColor=Gold}lowtown{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m03_011: Compared to up here, it's a much different\natmosphere...but one you're likely accustomed to.
MID_LGA_1LED_c04_Sci_m03: <BLN>Shall I give you a tour?
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Moo_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Moo_m02_001: That opening ceremony was INCREDIBLE! Tens of\nthousands of people in one spot?
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Moo_m02_002: I mean, wow! No matter where I looked, there were\npeople, and people, and more people!
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Moo_m02_003: I know this is a big city, but seriously. Where do they\nfit them all?
MID_LGA_1LED_c04_Moo_m02: <BLN>I mean, wow!
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Oly_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Oly_m02_001: As one would expect in a major metropolis like this,\nthe place abounds with sophisticates!
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Oly_m02_002: Yes—I simply must pop by the market later and\nglean what I can of the capital's latest trends.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Oly_m02_003: Anything interesting I learn, I'll bring it to Kalla's\nattention, tout de suite.
MID_LGA_1LED_c04_Oly_m02: <BLN>I ought to go to the market.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Buc_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Buc_m03_001: I'd prefer to handle our business with Lechner\nbefore the Heroic Games begin.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Buc_m03_002: Like you, I find that man's actions deplorable.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Buc_m03_003: If not for him, Lord Guillermo may not have lost his\nlife that day.
MID_LGA_1LED_c04_Buc_m03: <BLN>A despicable man.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m04_001: We have some time before the day of the match,\nand I'd suggest we not spend it idly.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m04_002: There are many in this city in need of help,\nfortunately for us—if not for them.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Sci_m04_003: We may have something to gain by fulfilling\ntheir requests.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Moo_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Moo_m03_001: Leda, I had a thought. What if we got inside the\narena somehow?
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Moo_m03_002: We might be able to talk with gladiators connected\nto the Heroic Games!
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Moo_m03_003: On second thought...we are wanted criminals.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Moo_m03_004: Maybe it's not the best idea to barge into places full\nof temple officials and soldiers.
MID_LGA_1LED_c04_Moo_m03: <BLN>I had a thought.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Oly_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Oly_m03_001: I am no more inclined than you to let this Lechner\nman get away with what he's done.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Oly_m03_002: To play with young Leilidahna's heart and leave her\nwith such a deep wound! Hmph.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Oly_m03_003: It's all the more loathsome when I recall how pure\nand innocent you were at the temple.
MID_LGA_1LED_c04_Oly_m03: <BLN>Absolutely loathsome!
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Car_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Car_m03_001: Leilidahna, are you well? I am relieved to hear you\naren't having any problems.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Car_m03_002: I'm sure I don't need to remind you that the Heroic\nGames are a gathering of the mightiest warriors.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Car_m03_003: You will need to refine your skills if you wish to\nachieve your goal.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_Car_m03_004: Only if you and your allies make every effort shall the\npath open before you.
MID_LGA_1LED_c04_Car_m03: <BLN>You must make every effort.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_B02_m01_001: The Divine Sovereign is about to announce the\nopening of the Heroic Games.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_B02_m01_002: If you are headed to the arena, simply head down\nthe stairs and follow this path.
MID_LGA_1LED_c04_B02_m01: <BLN>It is soon to begin.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_B03_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_B03_B04_m01_001: I heard that, whoever wins, the Divine Sovereign will\ngrant any wish they want?
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_B03_B04_m01_002: Darn. Maybe I should have entered.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_B03_B04_m01_003: Sure. Except that you're so lousy with a weapon,\nyou'd be out in the qualifiers.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_B03_B04_m01_004: Remember, the Heroic Games have the best fighters\nfrom all over Dagda competing.
MID_LGA_1LED_c04_B03_m01: <BLN>I missed out.
MID_LGA_1LED_c04_B04_m01: <BLN>Sure.